# app: hackernews
# Hacker News left with a story open (a power-off, or the idle sleep screen: D38): opened again within the hour, what was
# open is back at the page it was left at, with what was under it. Left from the list: the list next time.
# (data/config.json: power.autoOffMin 0, so the hour without a touch brings no sleep screen: D38)
wait 1500
# Left with the article open: the article again, at its page; back gives the list.
tap 270 269
wait 1500
tap 400 500
wait 1500
expect-state article=38250001|Page 2 of 4
restart
wait 1500
shot hackernews-resume-article
expect-state article=38250001|Page 2 of 4
back
wait 1500
expect-state section=top|stories=30|page=1/5|Updated 13:34
restart
wait 1500
expect-state section=top|stories=30|page=1/5|
# Left with the comments open over the article: the comments at their page; back gives the article, back again the list.
tap 270 269
wait 1500
tap 400 500
wait 1500
tap 430 917
wait 1500
tap 400 500
tap 400 500
wait 1500
expect-state story=38250001|comments=13|Page 3 of 5|next
restart
wait 1500
shot hackernews-resume
expect-state story=38250001|comments=13|Page 3 of 5|next
tap 70 917
wait 1500
expect-state article=38250001|Page 2 of 4
back
wait 1500
expect-state section=top|stories=30|page=1/5|
# Left with the comments opened by a long press: the comments; their Article opens the article over them.
long 270 269
wait 1500
tap 400 500
wait 1500
restart
wait 1500
expect-state story=38250001|comments=13|Page 2 of 5|next
back
wait 1500
expect-state section=top|stories=30|page=1/5|
# More than an hour later: the list. (Left with a story open by a power-off, an hour off, then started.)
tap 270 269
wait 1500
power-off
wait 3700000
restart
wait 1500
expect-state section=top|stories=30|page=1/5|
